::SPEECH_U05_L08_UnitAssessment_Q01::
Question ID: SPEECH_U05_L08_UnitAssessment_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.SPEECH.COM.03
Question:
Unit 5 assessment item 1: Which choice best demonstrates mastery of revision, vocabulary, digital presentation, and publication?
{
~A. Publish the first draft without reviewing it#This choice is incomplete because it does not support clear publication, revision, audience awareness, or digital presentation quality.
=B. Apply feedback to improve clarity and audience understanding#Correct. This choice supports publication-ready communication by improving clarity, collaboration, digital presentation, and audience understanding.
~C. Ignore audience needs during final review#This choice reflects a misconception. Recheck revision, publication readiness, audience impact, or slide coherence.
~D. Let everyone edit without roles or version control#This choice weakens the communication product because it ignores how the audience will use or understand it.
}
